  "title": "RGC Resources, Inc. Reports First Quarter 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "ROANOKE, Va. (February 5, 2026)–RGC Resources, Inc. (Nasdaq: RGCO) announced consolidated Company earnings of $4.9 million, or $0.47 per share, for the first quarter ended December 31, 2025, compared to $5.3 million, or $0.51 per share, for the first quarter ended December 31, 2024. The decrease reflected flat margins and higher costs for personnel, IT,",
